  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies source code that was produced by a code generator.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This annotation can distinguish generated source code from user-written code in the same file. <see cref="M:Javax.Annotation.Processing.IGenerated.Value" /> identifies the generator, while <see cref="M:Javax.Annotation.Processing.IGenerated.Date" /> and <see cref="M:Javax.Annotation.Processing.IGenerated.Comments" /> provide optional generation details.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
